name thesis-qom
category Package
revision 63524
shortdesc Thesis style of the University of Qom, Iran
longdesc This package provides a class file for writing theses and
longdesc dissertations according to the University of Qom Graduate
longdesc Schools's guidelines for the electronic submission of master
longdesc theses and PhD dissertations. The class should meet all the
longdesc current requirements and is updated whenever the university
longdesc guidelines change. The class needs XeLaTeX in conjunction with
longdesc the following fonts: XB Niloofar, IranNastaliq, IRlotus, XB
longdesc Zar, XB Titre, and Yas.
